                                "sense_id": "74fa81ef-313d-3d33-b36b-2be5d52bf2d2",
                                "text": "He promised handsome rewards to prospectors who uncovered long-anticipated mineral deposits and to those who would help make the Amazon a spiceland to replace the sources of cloves, ginger, cinnamon, and nutmeg that Portugal had lost in the East."
                            }
